Sign into Google Cloud first. Run:
  $ gcloud auth application-default login

To view the log, split terminal and run:
  $ tail -f output-vertex_ai/09-01-15-23-09/run-vertex_ai.out
    or
  $ vi output-vertex_ai/09-01-15-23-09/run-vertex_ai.out

To filter out the errors, run:
  $ grep ERROR output-vertex_ai/09-01-15-23-09/run-vertex_ai.out | cut -d '|' -f 3- | sort | uniq
  To replace the delimiter from | to :, replace -d '|' with -d ':'

MODEL_NAME=gemini-2.5-flash

